/div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tDefeating Magnor isn't very complicated and the players should just attack it, specially with <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a>. When it dies, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Shard%20of%20Magnor\">Shards of Magnor</a> will spawn, sharing the same health pool. They die rather quickly, but care must be taken since when dying they explode dealing high <a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\">Life Drain</a> damage. To mitigate the damage taken by the blockers, they can split the Shards between then and block them far away from each other. Shooters should also stay far from the boss to avoid this damage\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Undead_Humanoids\">Undead Humanoids</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Abominable%20Servant\">Abominable Servant</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Ugly%20Monster\">Ancient Ugly Monster</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Mummy\">Animated Mummy</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bad%20Thought\">Bad Thought</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Banshee\">Banshee</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blight%20Mariner\">Blight Mariner</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blightwalker\">Blightwalker</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boogey\">Boogey</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brain%20Head\">Brain Head</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Channeling%20Earl%20Osam\">Channeling Earl Osam</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Count%20Vlarkorth\">Count Vlarkorth</a></li><li><a href=